# Change 1: 2FA OTP Login, Multi-Modal Course Studio & Anti-Skip Player

Implements mandatory 2FA OTP verification for all email/password logins, automated first-time welcome email dispatch via Gmail SMTP, Course Creator studio overhaul with multi-modal content authoring (Video default with auto-duration detection, PDF, Word, Image) via clean dropdown, and Student Player forward-seek anti-skip enforcement with real-time progression tracking.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Mandatory OTP on Every Login**: Every email/password sign-in will now require a 6-digit verification passcode dispatched to the user's registered email via Gmail SMTP before granting access to dashboards.
> - **Automated Welcome Email**: Dispatched automatically to the user's inbox upon their first-time successful OTP login after registration.
> - **Course Creator Terminology**: Rebrands all creator views from *"Modules"* to **"Courses"**.
> - **Anti-Skip Protection**: Students will be strictly prevented from fast-forwarding or skipping uncompleted video lectures. Subsequent lectures remain locked (🔒) until the current lecture is 100% completed.

