### Component 3: Platform Performance & Latency Optimization

#### [MODIFY] [server/src/utils/prisma.js](file:///c:/Users/Ashwin/Desktop/LMS/server/src/utils/prisma.js)
- **Asynchronous Non-Blocking Dual-Write**: Detach backup database replication to run in the background via `setImmediate` / asynchronous worker so that primary database requests return to the browser in **< 25ms** without blocking the user interface.
